        "original_id": "bada307f-0b0f-58c7-ab97-f531df92df66",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Colin Thiele\n- Places: Thiele Highway, Bower, South Australia, Eudunda, Morgan\n- Topics: naming of places, Australian literature\n\nFacts:\n- Colin Thiele was an Australian author and educator who was born on 16 November 1920 and died on 4 September 2006.\n- Thiele Highway is named after author Colin Thiele.\n- Colin Thiele lived most of his life in towns along the route of Thiele Highway.\n- Colin Thiele set some of his stories in the area along Thiele Highway.\n- Bower is a town in South Australia on the Thiele Highway.\n- Bower is located approximately halfway between Eudunda and Morgan.",
